The surveillance system is established to maintain the following security measures while operating ASI facilities:

- - -

To enhance the safety and security of students, faculty, staff, employees and guests;
To protect ASI facilities and personal property;
To deter theft and vandalism;

All information and images obtained through the surveillance system shall be used exclusively for public safety, security, and law enforcement purposes. Surveillance systems will maintain personal expectations for privacy in restroom areas.
